  <Title type="string">Notes on triangles as a form of apology</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Chiamaka Zielińska talks about a sculpture made entirely of hesitation. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</synopsis>
